## 📋 About

**AFRINTEL** is an open-source Cyber Threat Intelligence (CTI) initiative focused on tracking and documenting cyber threats affecting African organizations.  
The project collects, structures, and analyzes ransomware and data-leak incidents based on direct observation of leak sites and public reporting.

### 🎯 Objectives

- 📊 Document ransomware and data-leak incidents targeting Africa
- 🛡️ Provide SOC-ready CTI reports (actionable + mapped to MITRE ATT&CK)
- 🤝 Facilitate sharing of Indicators of Compromise (IoCs) when available
- 🌍 Raise awareness across African sectors about evolving cyber threats

